    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per hour</p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You let out a howl that resonates and elicits a response from your allies to work together. You and any allies who hear or see you howl gain a +1 circumstance bonus to the next skill check they make. An ally who gains this bonus can respond as a reaction to howl back, increasing the circumstance bonus to a +2. If you become Legendary in any of the required skills, a second ally can also use their reaction to similarly howl back to increase the bonus to a +3. After receiving its effects, a creature cannot benefit from Communal Howl again until an hour has passed.</span></p><p>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.ancestries.g1DRqtRGa0M17Gvf]{Effect: Communal Howl}</p>"
